From c87881f153ef3f114f2192fbc9405527995893a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:05:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Result screen: 3D bottom buttons, region item icon cards,
 chest stays open after claiming
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 「下一关」「回小岛」: home-style wooden buttons, height 56, plate artScale 0.6 (was 0.45/48), 5-unit drop
  shadow behind the face, identical widths, one centred row (y raised to clear the shadow; reserve 72/60 -> 80/68).
- Chest hero fits what the page has left: 240 × 216 on 390 × 844 with WeChat capsule/home insets, min 96 × 86,
  rays sized with it; a ready chest is named by 「全部领取」 under it (no duplicate 打开宝箱 line).
- Region items are icon cards (120 × 120, 120 × 96 on short pages): chest-style rays + icon on top, item name
  below (TOOL_NAMES, e.g. 潮汐网), cream well with border and a 4-unit shadow, centred row; the long per-item
  claim bar is gone (「全部领取」 is the only claim). Claimed cards carry the stamp.
- Claimed chest: ResultChest3D.open(false) so the lid stays at the chest_open end pose (-118°).
- Short pages (available < 600 / < 520) shrink the stars so the whole result stays on one page.
- New tools/board-ui/test_result_screen_style.cjs (added to run-suite as result-screen-style) and
  test_claim_batch.cjs (result-claim-batch); test_result_safe_area accepts the chest named by 全部领取.
